//RS 
//RS /// The checked source function of every callable declaration, keyed by its
//RS /// module and declaration span, with whether its owner type is generic. The
//RS /// cost passes ask once per callable, so the items are walked once per pass
//RS /// instead of once per question (which made `jet check` quadratic).
